# THE NUMBERS WALK 6b — THE EXAM DOCKET OF CHUKAT, part E: the topic rows of Mishnah Kelim 1-2 and 9-10, Mikvaot 1-2, Keritot 1, Shevuot
# 1-2, Eduyot 1:14 and 6:2-3, Rosh Hashanah 3:8, Avot 5:6, and the two Seder Olam Rabbah segments (the Midrash shelf, the fortieth year's
# chronology); every row read whole from the dump before its verdict.
