 ('Mishnah Shevuot 2:2', 'LAW', "the original courtyard and its addition alike — the addition by the king, a prophet, the Urim, the Sanhedrin of seventy-one, two thanks offerings and the song; without them no offering and no karet for the enterer. CELL corpse_tumah('karet_entry') -> the sanctified area's bound. Credited (three ledgers)."),
